{{fbdoc item="title" value="__FB_GOSUB_SETJMP__"}}----
Intrinsic define (macro value) set by the compiler

{{fbdoc item="syntax"}}##
	""__FB_GOSUB_SETJMP__""
##
{{fbdoc item="desc"}}
	Returns non-zero (-1) when the setjmp/longjmp implementation of GOSUB is enabled with ##-z gosub-setjmp##, or zero (0) otherwise.

{{fbdoc item="ver"}}
	- Since fbc 1.20.4

{{fbdoc item="see"}}
	- [[CompilerOptz|Compiler Option: -z]]
	- ##[[KeyPgGosub|Gosub]]##

{{fbdoc item="back" value="CatPgDddefines|Intrinsic Defines"}}
